{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>網上流傳一段車Cam影片，見到今日（19日）下午大約5時06分，將軍澳廣場對開有一個半個人般高的垃圾桶從天而降，差點擊中附近途人。網民留言指，「永遠都係咁，冇人post就當冇事發生」。警方指，暫沒發現接獲相關報案。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T17:01:01.322016+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:06:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T07:17:44.014836+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:54:22.387725+00:00","content_hash":"2ea8fcb280e36d632070db1c620cbc97291ec07dc5f8ca9b9bf80eff283d595a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}